{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-05", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906753, "segment_id": "l2Jnvl6oqE", "segment_broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Lester Holt (New York)", "segment_description": null, "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906753, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-05", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906753, "segment_id": "4NII1G7dwP", "segment_broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "segment_title": "Campaign 2008 / Obama vs. McCain / Battleground States", "segment_description": "(Studio: Lester Holt)  The political landscape in the final weeks of the presidential race between Senators Barack Obama and John McCain introduced.  \n\n(Chicago: Lee Cowan)  The presidential election campaign featured; Obama TV ad shown; details given about the Bill Ayers issue.  [OBAMA&nbsp- says McCain is running a shell game on taxes.]  [Governor Sarah PALIN&nbsp- speaks against Obama.]  [Yesterday, in Carson, California, PALIN&nbsp- says Obama \"palled around\" with terrorists.]  [OBAMA&nbsp- says McCain is trying to distract you with smears.]  The death of Senator Joe Biden's mother-in-law mentioned.  The Obama TV ad accusing McCain of being erratic discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Lester Holt; Washington: Savannah Guthrie)  The line of attack from Palin against Obama discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Lester Holt)  Report introduced.  \n\n(Studio: Chuck Todd)  The battleground electoral map in the race reviewed; electronic map of states moving into the Obama column and of states in doubt shown.  \n\n(Studio: Lester Holt)  Tuesday's presidential debate mentioned. ", "segment_duration": 360, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63040.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906754, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-05", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906753, "segment_id": "8NldmqIFWk", "segment_broadcast_id": "el1uOaQzls", "segment_title": "Congressional Elections / Musgrave and Shays", "segment_description": "(Studio: Lester Holt)  Report introduced.   (Ft. Morgan, Colorado: John Yang)  The uphill battle for conservative Republican Representative Marilyn Musgrave, who is seeking a fourth term, featured; scenes shown of Musgrave on the local scene in Ft. Morgan, Colorado.  [In Congress, MUSGRAVE&nbsp- speaks against the bailout bill.]  [Colorado pollster Floyd CIRULI&#134;- says it is a tough Republican year.]  Photos shown of six senators who could be in trouble in the November elections.  [Connecticut Representative Chris SHAYS&nbsp- says he puts his country first.] ", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63400.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906755, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "el1uO